# inspector_jog_scrub_undo.scn — 活體牙 (L2): the jog手感 drag alignment to TiXL SingleValueEdit.
# Two NEW guarantees this scenario locks (beyond inspector_param_reset.scn's drag+reset):
#
#   A. NON-CLAMP SCRUB PAST RANGE (= TiXL default: a drag may leave [min,max]; the runtime bounds
#      internally where it matters). RadialPoints.RadiusOffset has range [-10,10] and does NOT opt
#      into clamp, so its jog speed is dragSpeedFor = |−10−10|/100 = 0.2 units/px (inspector_jog.h,
#      = TiXL GetScaleFromRange). A +100px drag therefore moves ≈ +20 and the override lands ABOVE
#      maxV=10 — impossible under the OLD hardcoded 0.01f speed + unconditional AlwaysClamp (which
#      capped at 10 and only moved +1). Asserting value>10 proves BOTH the derived speed (0.2, not
#      the old 0.01) and the non-clamp at once (measured ≈20).
#   B. ONE DRAG = ONE UNDO STEP (= TiXL ParameterWindow.cs:594-622: Started opens ONE in-flight
#      ChangeInputValueCommand, Finished pushes it once). A single Cmd+Z must fully erase the drag's
#      override back to the definition default — not unwind it pixel-by-pixel.
#
# RED proofs:
#   - (A) change 'value > 10' to 'value <= 10' -> FAIL (the scrub really left the range; if the old
#         clamp/speed were back, value would sit at ≤10 and this would pass — so it guards the change).
#   - (B) change the post-undo 'all(. == false)' to 'any' -> FAIL (one Cmd+Z really erased the whole drag).

open app/testdata/compound_smoke.swproj

# Enter EmitterComp (node:1 in Root) and select RadialPoints (node:1 inside).
do double @node:1^
assert_state '(.compositionPath | length) == 1'
do click @node:1^
# Baseline: RadiusOffset at its definition default (no override).
assert_state '[.lib.symbols[] | select(.id=="EmitterComp") | .children[] | select(.id==1) | .overrides | has("RadiusOffset")] | all(. == false)'
echo radiusoffset-starts-default

# A. JOG scrub +100px right. speed 0.2 -> ≈ +20 -> override materializes ABOVE maxV=10 (non-clamp).
do drag @param:RadiusOffset +100 +0
wait 0.4
assert_state '[.lib.symbols[] | select(.id=="EmitterComp") | .children[] | select(.id==1) | .overrides | has("RadiusOffset")] | any'
assert_state '([.lib.symbols[] | select(.id=="EmitterComp") | .children[] | select(.id==1) | .overrides["RadiusOffset"]] | add) > 10'
capture full scrubbed_past_range
echo scrub-went-past-maxV-nonclamp

# B. ONE Cmd+Z fully reverts the whole drag to the definition default (one drag = one undo command).
# Click the node title to give the canvas focus (Cmd+Z gated on IsWindowFocused), then Cmd+Z.
do click @node:1^
wait 0.3
do keychord cmd z
wait 0.4
assert_state '[.lib.symbols[] | select(.id=="EmitterComp") | .children[] | select(.id==1) | .overrides | has("RadiusOffset")] | all(. == false)'
echo one-undo-reverted-the-whole-drag
